## Commercial Use

Commercial use of ThreatForge ThreatModel is permitted.

Organizations may:

- Integrate ThreatForge ThreatModel into commercial security products.
- Use it in CI/CD pipelines.
- Use it for internal security assessments.
- Use it for security architecture and threat-modeling activities.
- Use it as part of authorized security services.
- Modify it for their own requirements.
- Build additional functionality around it.

Distribution of MPL-covered ThreatForge ThreatModel source code remains subject to the requirements of the MPL-2.0.

